  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Support Measures for Suriname - Improving communication and public diplomacy (service contract)</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">&lt;p&gt;Service contract for a Strategic Communication Facility for Suriname under NDICI &#xbf; Global Europe and the Global Gateway agenda. Over 18 months, the contractor will design and implement a large-scale, multi&#xbf;channel communication campaign, primarily targeting urban youth (18&#xbf;35), to increase awareness of the EU&#xbf;s added value and strengthen the perception of the EU as a key, trustworthy partner in Suriname and globally.&lt;/p&gt;</narrative>
  </description>
